@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : PIN Verified
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : PIN Incorrect
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal Selected
ProcessingWithdrawal --> Dispensing : Withdrawal Approved
Dispensing --> Printing : Cash Dispensed
Printing --> EjectingCard : Receipt Printed
EjectingCard --> Resetting : Card Ejected
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> EjectingCard : Cancel
ValidatingPIN --> EjectingCard : Cancel
ProcessingWithdrawal --> EjectingCard : Request Rejected
Resetting --> Idle : System Ready
EjectingCard --> [*] : Completion
@enduml
